---
// Why.astro — the thesis band (VISION §4.3). Static, confident, measured prose (§8).
// The argument's pivot: "dropping a powerful model on a hard task and hoping is not engineering."
// One big claim, generous space, no decoration. class="reveal" (T6's reveal.ts fades it up).
//
// No interactive markup, no internal asset URLs → no island wiring, no withBase needed here.
---

<section class="why reveal" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <div class="container why__inner">
    <p class="why__eyebrow eyebrow">The thesis</p>
    <h2 id="why-title" class="why__claim">
      Dropping a powerful model on a hard task and <em>hoping</em> is not engineering.
    </h2>
    <p class="why__body muted">
      A capable model will produce something. Whether it produced the <em>right</em> thing,
      at the right altitude, with the bar held — that is a separate question, and most setups
      never ask it. Agentry treats orchestration as engineering: the work is shaped to the least
      process that wins, built by specialists inside clean boundaries, and checked against an
      acceptance bar before it counts as done. And the system measures itself — so the bar isn't
      a claim, it's a number you can read.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .why {
    /* a touch tighter than .section's 150px so it reads as a bridge, not a full stop */
    padding-block: 120px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-soft);
  }

  .why__inner {
    max-width: 920px;
  }

  .why__eyebrow {
    margin-bottom: 22px;
  }

  .why__claim {
    /* the band's whole job is this sentence — let it breathe big */
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4.4vw, 52px);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    max-width: 18ch;
  }

  /* emphasis carries meaning ("hoping", "right"), not color — amber would break discipline */
  .why__claim em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  .why__body {
    font-size: clamp(16px, 1.4vw, 19px);
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 64ch;
  }

  .why__body em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .why {
      padding-block: 88px;
    }
  }
</style>
